    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμπ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blameworthy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				462
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.70
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμπτότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.61
				</span></i>
			: mostly with a neg., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				220
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1036
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.57
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μ.</span> not
				<i>contemptible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				187c
			</span></i>; in a question, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.48
			</span></i>. Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ τῶν ξένων μεμπτῶς μαχεσαμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cleom.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>throwing blame upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				446
			</span></i>, where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμπτός</span> is
		fem.</div>
